{"title":"Geometry/Resources","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Listed below are various geometry resources including books, classes, websites, and computer software.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Books</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Introductory\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Introductory</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Intermediate\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Intermediate</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Olympiad\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Olympiad</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Lower\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Lower</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Upper\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Upper</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Websites\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Websites</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Classes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Classes</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Introductory_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Introductory</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Olympiad_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Olympiad</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Software\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Software</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#EBooks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">EBooks</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books\">Books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Introductory\">Introductory</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Introductory\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/store/book/intro-geometry\">The Art of Problem Solving Introduction to Geometry</a> by Richard Rusczyk</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Intermediate\">Intermediate</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Intermediate\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//store.doverpublications.com/products/9780486691541?_pos=2&amp;_sid=8169fdb25&amp;_ss=r\">Challenging Problems in Geometry</a> by Charles T. Salkind and Alfred S. Posamentier.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//store.doverpublications.com/collections/math-geometry/products/9780486462370\">Advanced Euclidean Geometry</a>by Roger A. Johnson</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.wiley.com/en-us/Advanced+Euclidean+Geometry%3A+Excursions+for+Secondary+Teachers+and+Students-p-9780470412565\">Advanced Euclidean Geometry</a> by Alfred S. Posamentier</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Olympiad\">Olympiad</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Olympiad\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Lower\">Lower</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Lower\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//bookstore.ams.org/view?ProductCode=NML/19\">Geometry Revisited</a> by Coxeter and Greitzer</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Upper\">Upper</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Upper\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://kskedlaya.org/geometryunbound/\">Geometry Unbound</a> by Kiran Kedlaya</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//bookstore.ams.org/view?ProductCode=PRB/27\">Euclidean Geometry in Mathematical Olympiads</a> (EGMO) by Evan Chen</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Websites\">Websites</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Websites\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All of these links are outside of [AoPSWiki].\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.cut-the-knot.org/geometry.shtml\">Cut-the-Knot's Geometry Section</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ics.uci.edu/~eppstein/junkyard/\">The Geometry Junkyard</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=4\">AoPS-ML Olympiad Geometry Forum</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Classes\">Classes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Classes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Introductory_2\">Introductory</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Introductory\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>The <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/school/course/intro-geometry\">Introduction to Geometry</a> class is where you can learn introductory geometry.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Olympiad_2\">Olympiad</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Olympiad\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>The <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/school/course/woot-math\">Worldwide Online Olympiad Training Program</a> is designed to help students learn to tackle <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_Olympiad\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematical Olympiad\">mathematical Olympiad</a> problems in topics such as geometry.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> has an <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/school/course/olympiad-geometry\">Olympiad Geometry</a> course for those aiming to tackle USAMO-level geometry problems.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Software\">Software</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Software\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>These are all outside links.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.geometer.org/geometer/\">Geometer</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.keypress.com/sketchpad/\">The Geometer's Sketchpad</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mit.edu/~ibaran/kseg.html\">KSEG</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://edu.kde.org/kig/\">KIG</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://asymptote.sourceforge.net/\">Asymptote</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"EBooks\">EBooks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: EBooks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Viktor Prasolov - <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://students.imsa.edu/~tliu/Math/planegeo.pdf\">Plane Geometry</a></li>\n<li>Hojoo Lee - <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://myhome.personaldb.net/ideahitme/trig.pdf\">Triangle Geometry Formulas</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Resources&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">Geometry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Introduction\" title=\"Geometry/Introduction\"> Introductory Geometry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Intermediate\" title=\"Geometry/Intermediate\"> Intermediate Geometry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry/Olympiad\" title=\"Geometry/Olympiad\"> Olympiad Geometry</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017224333\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 41/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3623:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017224333 and revision id 291767. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}